# .trivyignore — Trivy vulnerability suppression list
# Format: https://aquasecurity.github.io/trivy/latest/docs/configuration/filtering/#by-finding-ids
# Entries have NO TTL — they accumulate indefinitely by design.
# Add entries ONLY with a comment explaining: CVE ID, affected package, justification, date added.
#
# Example entry format:
# CVE-2023-XXXXX  # pkg: example-package@1.0.0 | justification: not reachable via our code | added: 2025-01-01
